the mandatory one-at-a-time restart protocol on both node1 and node2, proving boot-id changes and post-restart recovery of the hold and Ansible control connectivity.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Surveyed node1 (Ubuntu 24.04, curl 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8, no ansible) and node2 (ansible-core 2.20.5 installed) to identify node2 as the Ansible control node\",\"Fixed node1 sshd (missing host keys via ssh-keygen -A, started ssh.service) so node2 could reach it over SSH\",\"Installed node2's existing root SSH pubkey into node1's authorized_keys for passwordless Ansible connections\",\"Wrote /root/ansible-curl-hold/inventory.ini and hold-curl.yml on node2 using ansible.builtin.dpkg_selections to hold curl on node1\",\"Ran the playbook (changed=1 first run; ok/changed=0 on rerun, confirming idempotency)\",\"Ran a real apt-get update && apt-get upgrade -y on node1 and confirmed curl remained pinned at 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8 (apt-mark showhold still lists curl) while unrelated packages upgraded\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and health baselines for both nodes\",\"Restarted node1 (backgrounded reboot), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, and reverified curl hold/version plus a no-op Ansible run from node2\",\"Restarted node2 (backgrounded reboot), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, and reverified ansible functionality, SSH connectivity to node1, and playbook idempotency\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"curl current version identified before hold\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-02e39d6bf6c6409d\"],\"summary\":\"dpkg -l curl on node1 shows installed version 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 identified as Ansible control node\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7549c16dcff74949\",\"cmd-75dde1ffc2d54e2a\"],\"summary\":\"node2 has ansible/ansible-playbook installed; node1 does not\"},{\"requirement\":\"SSH connectivity established for Ansible\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-e7ec83e345764752\",\"cmd-887d018317464135\",\"cmd-59ab428505814e15\",\"cmd-8594336142d34139\",\"cmd-32f5b9e06e044096\",\"cmd-a169e5b3ee554bf9\",\"cmd-e57cc2ddfce14407\"],\"summary\":\"Diagnosed and fixed node1 sshd (missing host keys), installed node2 pubkey, confirmed passwordless SSH root@node1 works\"},{\"requirement\":\"Ansible playbook created and applies the hold\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b8210386ea7d4835\",\"cmd-606e7b37276b40a1\",\"cmd-59750b59522341eb\"],\"summary\":\"Inventory and dpkg_selections playbook written on node2; first run reports changed=1, before=install after=hold\"},{\"requirement\":\"Hold is idempotent / correctly applied\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3930be1e5b5c4e3d\",\"cmd-4e758ad35de04e43\"],\"summary\":\"apt-mark showhold and dpkg --get-selections show curl held; playbook rerun reports changed=0\"},{\"requirement\":\"Functional proof: system update leaves curl version unchanged\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-bc0d4eadefe64c87\",\"cmd-381f7892fd104922\",\"cmd-9b198dc39c044f58\"],\"summary\":\"Newer curl 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.15 was available; ran full apt-get upgrade -y; curl package version remained 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8 afterward while other packages upgraded\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7c343478657e4842\"],\"summary\":\"Captured node1 boot_id 901ef286-c79c-44c0-ad2c-cfde1f6daa7a, ssh state, curl hold, and version before restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-cb0ef59d2d75468d\",\"cmd-c032b8beeb044a4f\",\"cmd-5049f6d1b9b7450f\",\"cmd-25afb83b7b3a4592\"],\"summary\":\"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged; connection timed out mid-reboot; boot_id changed to f90c5d43-5d0b-4b1a-a3d0-9ddab3693f8c after recovery\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: post-restart recovery proof\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-61dd26fda83e4bd7\",\"cmd-5e36074d762f4fdf\"],\"summary\":\"curl still held at 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8, ssh.socket active; Ansible playbook from node2 reports ok/changed=0 confirming state and connectivity recovered\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-b78e172309ea4304\"],\"summary\":\"Captured node2 boot_id 6fd57414-83a2-4bff-91e3-33d229c2c635 and confirmed ansible functional before restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5cd5d0dcd3c94abc\",\"cmd-dfd56b6bd0924418\",\"cmd-fd1e107604004ade\",\"cmd-ca02af36182f42df\"],\"summary\":\"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged; connection timed out mid-reboot; boot_id changed to 8a35b0d7-e0b3-4736-aadb-9792a2024187 after recovery\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: post-restart recovery proof\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3c88c79af9e242af\"],\"summary\":\"ansible functional, SSH to node1 works, playbook files intact, and playbook rerun reports ok/changed=0 confirming full control-node recovery\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Used Ansible from node2 (the only node with ansible installed) as the control node to hold curl at its current pinned version on node1, via an idempotent dpkg_selections playbook. Verified functionally with a real system upgrade: curl stayed at 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8 even though a newer version (8.5.0-2ubuntu10.15) was available and other packages upgraded. Completed the mandatory one-at-a-time restart protocol on both node1 and node2, proving boot-id changes and post-restart recovery of the hold and Ansible control connectivity.","actions_performed":["Surveyed node1 (Ubuntu 24.04, curl 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8, no ansible) and node2 (ansible-core 2.20.5 installed) to identify node2 as the Ansible control node","Fixed node1 sshd (missing host keys via ssh-keygen -A, started ssh.service) so node2 could reach it over SSH","Installed node2's existing root SSH pubkey into node1's authorized_keys for passwordless Ansible connections","Wrote /root/ansible-curl-hold/inventory.ini and hold-curl.yml on node2 using ansible.builtin.dpkg_selections to hold curl on node1","Ran the playbook (changed=1 first run; ok/changed=0 on rerun, confirming idempotency)","Ran a real apt-get update && apt-get upgrade -y on node1 and confirmed curl remained pinned at 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8 (apt-mark showhold still lists curl) while unrelated packages upgraded","Captured pre-restart boot_id and health baselines for both nodes","Restarted node1 (backgrounded reboot), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, and reverified curl hold/version plus a no-op Ansible run from node2","Restarted node2 (backgrounded reboot), polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, and reverified ansible functionality, SSH connectivity to node1, and playbook idempotency"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"curl current version identified before hold","command_ids":["cmd-02e39d6bf6c6409d"],"summary":"dpkg -l curl on node1 shows installed version 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8"},{"requirement":"node2 identified as Ansible control node","command_ids":["cmd-7549c16dcff74949","cmd-75dde1ffc2d54e2a"],"summary":"node2 has ansible/ansible-playbook installed; node1 does not"},{"requirement":"SSH connectivity established for Ansible","command_ids":["cmd-e7ec83e345764752","cmd-887d018317464135","cmd-59ab428505814e15","cmd-8594336142d34139","cmd-32f5b9e06e044096","cmd-a169e5b3ee554bf9","cmd-e57cc2ddfce14407"],"summary":"Diagnosed and fixed node1 sshd (missing host keys), installed node2 pubkey, confirmed passwordless SSH root@node1 works"},{"requirement":"Ansible playbook created and applies the hold","command_ids":["cmd-b8210386ea7d4835","cmd-606e7b37276b40a1","cmd-59750b59522341eb"],"summary":"Inventory and dpkg_selections playbook written on node2; first run reports changed=1, before=install after=hold"},{"requirement":"Hold is idempotent / correctly applied","command_ids":["cmd-3930be1e5b5c4e3d","cmd-4e758ad35de04e43"],"summary":"apt-mark showhold and dpkg --get-selections show curl held; playbook rerun reports changed=0"},{"requirement":"Functional proof: system update leaves curl version unchanged","command_ids":["cmd-bc0d4eadefe64c87","cmd-381f7892fd104922","cmd-9b198dc39c044f58"],"summary":"Newer curl 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.15 was available; ran full apt-get upgrade -y; curl package version remained 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8 afterward while other packages upgraded"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: healthy baseline","command_ids":["cmd-7c343478657e4842"],"summary":"Captured node1 boot_id 901ef286-c79c-44c0-ad2c-cfde1f6daa7a, ssh state, curl hold, and version before restart"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-cb0ef59d2d75468d","cmd-c032b8beeb044a4f","cmd-5049f6d1b9b7450f","cmd-25afb83b7b3a4592"],"summary":"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged; connection timed out mid-reboot; boot_id changed to f90c5d43-5d0b-4b1a-a3d0-9ddab3693f8c after recovery"},{"requirement":"node1 restart: post-restart recovery proof","command_ids":["cmd-61dd26fda83e4bd7","cmd-5e36074d762f4fdf"],"summary":"curl still held at 8.5.0-2ubuntu10.8, ssh.socket active; Ansible playbook from node2 reports ok/changed=0 confirming state and connectivity recovered"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: healthy baseline","command_ids":["cmd-b78e172309ea4304"],"summary":"Captured node2 boot_id 6fd57414-83a2-4bff-91e3-33d229c2c635 and confirmed ansible functional before restart"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: acknowledgement and changed boot identity","command_ids":["cmd-5cd5d0dcd3c94abc","cmd-dfd56b6bd0924418","cmd-fd1e107604004ade","cmd-ca02af36182f42df"],"summary":"Backgrounded reboot acknowledged; connection timed out mid-reboot; boot_id changed to 8a35b0d7-e0b3-4736-aadb-9792a2024187 after recovery"},{"requirement":"node2 restart: post-restart recovery proof","command_ids":["cmd-3c88c79af9e242af"],"summary":"ansible functional, SSH to node1 works, playbook files intact, and playbook rerun reports ok/changed=0 confirming full control-node recovery"}]},"ttft_ms":2935,"type":"result","duration_ms":215134,"uuid":"d58be721-f52d-4293-9e76-145eb17a55b9","ttft_stream_ms":1590,"time_to_request_ms":60,"first_content_frame_ms":1590,"queued_